{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack","id":359371,"title":"Wicked Bale Hounds vs Uber Rahu ( and a rest of Pack )","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-04T12:13:11-08:00","id":359371,"title":"Wicked Bale Hounds vs Uber Rahu ( and a rest of Pack )","content":"My Sweden game about Bale Hounds is coming to final. My PCs pack confronted with <i>Asah Gadar</i> in players sacred Locus, twice going in the trap the corrupted werewolves made them on route. Most of pack being almost dead ( only last or one previous Health box not marked by Aggravated wounds ), they let their Rahu leader in fetish armor to face 6 Bale Hounds as a duel with their Alpha. <i>Asah Gadar </i>leader used both silver crossbow bolt and silver knives, but missed most of the time - still, with help of 5 other Bale Hounds, they made Rahu to face about 2/3 of Health boxes in Aggravated wounds. When Hounds Alpha &quot;lay dead&quot; ( as Irraka, he just use Evasion Gift &quot;Playing Possum&quot; ), their Ithaeur summoned about 20 of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/319914-legion-corrupted-spirits\">Legions</a> demons that circled group. In the meantime, rest of the PCs pack summoned their bear totem spirit. Demons circled all the werewolves in Locus, 5 Bale Hounds are fighting with PCs uber-Rahu ( becuase of his Armor he get's any demage only at levels 6+ ), and PCs totem and Irraka are joining in the fight. In one sentence - much boring combat mess.<br /> <br /> <b>What I need is some kind of twist to break this tiresome situation</b>. Of course, I can play that 5 Hounds and 20 demons are fighting with PCs for the whole next game session, but at least one player ( PCs Ithaeur ) that did not take part in fight sits on side. I'm much more in vain that Bale Hounds made something that makes PCs to break combat mode and run, chase or just moved to other location. I was thinking maybe something about making PCs Locus temporal Wound, but I do not know if Bale Hounds have this kind of power. Maybe you have some other idea to break the fight now and do not resume combat as full game session event?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-04-2015, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T12:17:00-08:00","id":359389,"title":"","content":"What is the resonance of the locus they're at? If it's not something compatible with fighting or violence, the energy the fight is giving off might start corrupting it <i>fast</i>. That many evil spirits in one place is also going to start poisoning the land at some point, and Luna <i>help them</i> if they're standing over a ley line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T12:24:07-08:00","id":359409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack?p=359389#post359389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the resonance of the locus they're at?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's <i>Bear's Cemetary</i>, sacred place where animals comes to end their life and be guided by the packs Totem - <i>Light of the Dead</i>, bear star of dead - to the afterlife they should go. So I assume Locus resonance is... death?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack?p=359389#post359389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it's not something compatible with fighting or violence, the energy the fight is giving off might start corrupting it <i>fast</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does Death comes with or against this kind of conflict?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack?p=359389#post359389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That many evil spirits in one place is also going to start poisoning the land at some point, and Luna <i>help them</i> if they're standing over a ley line.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did not know the ley lines can work with Loci resonance, not only Hallows. Interesting...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T12:29:37-08:00","id":359421,"title":"","content":"Seems like a natural conclusion would be the player characters meeting their deaths and being guided by their Totem. After which they could safeguard the locus from further corruption through the spirits they created in their final fight.<br /> <br /> Bale Hounds would probably start making called shots at the holes in the rahu's super armor, gouging out his eyes and slicing his joints.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T12:38:22-08:00","id":359429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack?p=359421#post359421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems like a natural conclusion would be the player characters meeting their deaths and being guided by their Totem. After which they could safeguard the locus from further corruption through the spirits they created in their final fight.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting dark ending - will use it, if PCs will fell in pre-final battle. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack?p=359421#post359421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bale Hounds would probably start making called shots at the holes in the rahu's super armor, gouging out his eyes and slicing his joints.</div> </div> </div> </div>Problem is with attacking player as fetish armor is full plate resizing with forms ( yes, Gauru in full armor) , so character have Armor Rating 5 and there is not any way to make NPCs hit her on exposed part of it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T12:45:08-08:00","id":359433,"title":"","content":"Have the stronger spirits do a can opener: one spirit hacks off a piece, the bale hounds go in with a dirty weapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T13:02:26-08:00","id":359441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack?p=359433#post359433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have the stronger spirits do a can opener: one spirit hacks off a piece, the bale hounds go in with a dirty weapon.</div> </div> </div> </div>How spirit can hack off a piece of armor?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T13:09:10-08:00","id":359462,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/359371-wicked-bale-hounds-vs-uber-rahu-and-a-rest-of-pack?p=359441#post359441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How spirit can hack off a piece of armor?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's like asking how Godzilla can break off a building. Roll their attack plus your guy's defence, swarming Armour Guy if they have to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T13:14:15-08:00","id":359469,"title":"","content":"Assuming you want to go with Sikia's suggestion, I'd recommend using the rules for damaging an object. It's a magic item so the durability would apply to aggravated damage. Its durability would probably be 3 or 4 with a size of around 4-7 depending on the Rahu's current form (for a total structure between 7 and 11). Once the object has taken more than its durability in structure damage it is considered to be &quot;malfunctioning&quot;. In the case of armor, that would mean there would now be some holes in the armor to exploit.<br /> <br /> Edited to Add: There are various powers/merits that would make damaging the armor easier. There's also a lodge of werewolves that specialize in freeing spirits from fetishes, but that would probably be going a bit too far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3755,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3755-jaerys","user":"Jaerys","date":". 01-04-2015, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3755-jaerys","name":"Jaerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}